sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant S as Security
  participant C as Controller
  participant V as Service
  participant D as DAO
  participant DB as MySQL
  B->>S: POST /saveposition + _csrf
  S->>S: logged in? role allowed? token ok?
  S->>C: save(PositionInfo)
  C->>C: validate input
  C->>V: addPosition(info)
  V->>D: addPosition(info)
  D->>DB: count, then insert
  D-->>C: true, or false if duplicate
  C-->>B: redirect to list, or form + error
